    "(24 hours after the event). You can change it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ms" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "(24 jam selepas acara). Boleh ubah."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**Drive only when alert.** Don't drive when tired or sleepy, or under the influence of alcohol, drugs or medicine that makes you drowsy." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ms" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "**Pandu hanya bila cergas.** Jangan memandu ketika letih atau mengantuk, atau di bawah pengaruh alkohol, dadah atau ubat yang mengantukkan."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**Hands on the wheel, not the phone.** Set your destination before you move, or ask a passenger." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ms" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "**Tangan di stereng, bukan di telefon.** Tetapkan destinasi sebelum bergerak, atau minta penumpang."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**Manotu is only an aid.** Maps, routes and reports can be wrong or out of date. You drive and you decide." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ms" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "**Manotu alat bantu sahaja.** Peta, laluan dan laporan mungkin salah atau lapuk. Anda yang memandu dan membuat keputusan."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**Obey the traffic laws.** Road signs, traffic lights and the police always come before the app's directions." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ms" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "**Patuhi undang-undang jalan raya.** Papan tanda, lampu isyarat dan polis sentiasa didahulukan, bukan arahan aplikasi."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**Your responsibility.** To the extent permitted by law, the developer of Manotu is not responsible for accidents, injury, damage or fines." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ms" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "**Tanggungjawab anda.** Setakat yang dibenarkan undang-undang, pembangun Manotu tidak bertanggungjawab atas kemalangan, kecederaan, kerosakan atau saman."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "+ Add a missing place" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ms" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "+ Tambah tempat yang hilang"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "+ Time" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ms" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "+ Masa"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1 review" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ms" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "1 ulasan"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "24 h" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ms" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "24 jam"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "24 words that recreate your pseudonym's key. Write them down and keep them private: anyone with them can sign as you. Not needed if you back up." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ms" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "24 perkataan yang mencipta semula kunci nama samaran anda. Tulis dan simpan secara peribadi: sesiapa yang memilikinya boleh menandatangani sebagai anda. Tidak perlu jika anda membuat sandaran."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "24 words, separated by spaces" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ms" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "24 perkataan, dipisahkan dengan ruang"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "80 characters at most." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ms" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Maksimum 80 aksara."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A GPX file isn't encrypted. Anyone who gets it can read the route." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ms" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Fail GPX tidak disulitkan. Sesiapa yang mendapatnya boleh membaca laluan ini."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A contributor" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ms" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Seorang penyumbang"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A driver" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ms" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Seorang pemandu"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A few days" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ms" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Beberapa hari"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A maintainer will check it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ms" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Penyelenggara akan menyemaknya."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A military or strategic site, a shelter, a private home, or details such as guards and CCTV. Hidden at once while it's checked." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ms" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kawasan tentera atau strategik, rumah perlindungan, rumah persendirian, atau butiran seperti pengawal dan CCTV. Disembunyikan serta-merta sementara disemak."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A moderator will check this place before others can see it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ms" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tempat ini akan disemak oleh moderator sebelum orang lain nampak."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A note for guests is too long (1000 characters at most)." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ms" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nota untuk tetamu terlalu panjang (paling banyak 1000 aksara)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A place called %@ is already here." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ms" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tempat bernama %@ sudah ada di sini."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A place's notes are too long (500 characters at most)." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ms" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nota tempat terlalu panjang (maksimum 500 aksara)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A route still has legs to calculate. Open it when you're online, or keep them as sketches." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ms" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Masih ada kaki laluan yang perlu dikira. Buka laluan itu semasa dalam talian, atau simpan sebagai lakaran."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A shop or stall outside the fence? Move the pin to where it really is, outside the shaded area." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ms" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kedai atau gerai di luar pagar? Alih pin ke tempat sebenar, di luar kawasan berlorek."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A trip can have up to 5 stops" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ms" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Satu perjalanan boleh ada hingga 5 hentian"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "API base URL" : {
      "localizations" : {
