        "ms" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Padam tempat ini daripada telefon anda?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Delete your Manotu account?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ms" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Padam akaun Manotu anda?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Deletes the places on this phone first, then restores the backup." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ms" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Memadam tempat dalam telefon ini dahulu, kemudian memulihkan sandaran."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Deletes your pseudonym, reputation, votes, inbox and recovery from Manotu's server. Your public reviews, photos, places and reports stay, anonymised. Your places on this phone are kept unless you choose to clear them." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ms" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Memadam nama samaran, reputasi, undian, peti masuk dan pemulihan anda dari pelayan Manotu. Ulasan, foto, tempat dan laporan awam anda kekal, tanpa nama. Tempat anda dalam telefon ini disimpan melainkan anda memilih untuk mengosongkannya."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Delivery" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ms" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Penghantaran"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Demo" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ms" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Demo"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Demo data" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ms" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Data demo"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Demo data · server unreachable" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ms" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Data demo · pelayan tidak dapat dicapai"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Demo mode" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ms" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mod demo"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Demo mode has no account on the server. Turn off demo mode to delete your Manotu account." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ms" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mod demo tiada akaun di pelayan. Matikan mod demo untuk memadam akaun Manotu anda."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Demo mode lets you try Manotu anywhere, with no account." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ms" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mod demo membolehkan anda mencuba Manotu di mana-mana, tanpa akaun."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Demo mode off" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ms" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mod demo dimatikan"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Demo mode on: sample data, nothing is sent" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ms" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mod demo dihidupkan: data contoh, tiada apa-apa dihantar"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Demo mode uses built-in sample places, reports and routes around Kuala Lumpur, and drives along the route by itself (a simulated drive), so you can try everything from anywhere, without an account.\n\nNothing you do is sent to Manotu's server: searches, routes, reports, reviews, photos, complaints, feedback and crash reports stay on this phone (feedback is not delivered). Favourites, planned drives and backups work as usual. Map tiles still load from OpenFreeMap." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ms" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mod demo menggunakan contoh tempat, laporan dan laluan terbina dalam di sekitar Kuala Lumpur, dan memandu sendiri di sepanjang laluan (pemanduan simulasi), supaya anda boleh mencuba semuanya dari mana-mana, tanpa akaun.\n\nTiada apa yang anda lakukan dihantar ke pelayan Manotu: carian, laluan, laporan, ulasan, gambar, aduan, maklum balas dan laporan ranap kekal dalam telefon ini (maklum balas tidak dihantar). Kegemaran, pemanduan dirancang dan sandaran berfungsi seperti biasa. Jubin peta masih dimuatkan dari OpenFreeMap."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Demo mode — backend unreachable" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ms" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mod demo — pelayan tidak dapat dicapai"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Demo mode: feedback kept on this phone, not sent" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ms" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mod demo: maklum balas disimpan dalam telefon ini, tidak dihantar"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Demo mode: kept on this phone, not sent" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ms" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mod demo: disimpan dalam telefon ini, tidak dihantar"
