          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Manotu doesn't accept places, photos, reviews or details in military, security and strategic areas. Photographing or sketching a restricted area is also an offence under Act 298." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ms" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Manotu tidak menerima tempat, gambar, ulasan atau butiran di kawasan tentera, keselamatan dan strategik. Mengambil gambar atau melakar kawasan larangan juga satu kesalahan di bawah Akta 298."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Manotu keeps only an encrypted copy, without its key, until 14 days after the event." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ms" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Manotu hanya menyimpan salinan yang disulitkan, tanpa kuncinya, sehingga 14 hari selepas acara."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Manotu never knows who you are. Your public work is credited to this random pseudonym, which only your phone and your own backup can sign for." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ms" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Manotu tidak pernah tahu siapa anda. Sumbangan awam anda dikreditkan kepada nama samaran rawak ini, yang hanya telefon dan sandaran anda boleh tandatangani."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Manotu routes don't go through this area." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ms" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Laluan Manotu tidak melalui kawasan ini."
          }
        }
      }
    },
