        }
      }
    },
    "On Wi-Fi while charging, only when something changed. Automatic backups are not passphrase-locked, because Gimano never stores your passphrase." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "On Wi-Fi while charging, only when something changed. Automatic backups are not passphrase-locked, because Manotu never stores your passphrase."
          }
        },
        "ms" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Melalui Wi-Fi semasa mengecas, hanya jika ada perubahan. Sandaran automatik tidak dikunci dengan frasa laluan kerana Manotu tidak pernah menyimpan frasa laluan anda."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On this phone and in your own backup. You can share it as GPX." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ms" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Di telefon ini dan dalam sandaran anda sendiri. Boleh kongsi sebagai GPX."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "One place" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ms" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Satu tempat"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "One report never closes a road: drivers nearby are asked to confirm." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ms" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Satu laporan tidak pernah menutup jalan: pemandu berdekatan diminta mengesahkannya."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "One way" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ms" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sehala"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "One-off. Tap days to repeat every week." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ms" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sekali sahaja. Ketik hari untuk ulang setiap minggu."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Online" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ms" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dalam talian"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only asked when you've stopped within 1 km. Your phone checks the distance; your location isn't stored." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ms" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hanya ditanya bila anda berhenti dan berada dalam 1 km. Telefon menyemak jarak; lokasi anda tidak disimpan."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only if you choose Google Drive backup: signs in to your own Drive." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ms" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hanya jika anda memilih sandaran Google Drive: log masuk ke Drive anda sendiri."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only if you choose iCloud backup: your backup goes to your own iCloud." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ms" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hanya jika anda memilih sandaran iCloud: sandaran pergi ke iCloud anda sendiri."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only if you want us to contact you about this report. Kept encrypted, used for this report only, deleted automatically within 90 days (or any time from My feedback). Never added to your pseudonym." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ms" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hanya jika anda mahu kami menghubungi anda tentang laporan ini. Disulitkan, digunakan untuk laporan ini sahaja, dipadam secara automatik dalam 90 hari (atau bila-bila masa dari Maklum balas saya). Tidak sekali-kali dikaitkan dengan nama samaran anda."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only the author can change this review." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ms" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hanya penulis boleh mengubah ulasan ini."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only the coordinates and travel mode are sent to the routing server. Nothing is stored there." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ms" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hanya koordinat dan mod perjalanan dihantar ke pelayan laluan. Tiada apa disimpan di sana."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only you see this" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ms" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hanya anda yang nampak"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only your answer and that spot are sent, never your trip." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ms" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hanya jawapan anda dan titik itu dihantar, bukan perjalanan anda."
          }
        }
      }
    },
